<title>INDIA: POLL-India ACC 6-mth net seen down 64 pct.</title>
<headline>POLL-India ACC 6-mth net seen down 64 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Associated Cement Companies Ltd's (ACC) net profit is forecast to fall 64.7 percent to 194.10 million rupees in the first half of fiscal 1997/98 (April-March), according to a Reuter poll consensus on Wednesday.</p>
<p>ACC is India's largest cement firm.</p>
<p>Its sales in the first six months to September 30 are projected to fall 3.78 percent to 11.7 billion rupees, 18 leading brokerages and securities firms said.</p>
<p>Following are the details of the poll compared with actuals for the first half of 1996/97.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				NET PROFIT		   SALES</p>
<p>				   (first half to September 30)</p>
<p>			    97/98     96/97	97/98	96/97</p>
<p>					 (in millions of rupees)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>ACC ----PAT seen down 64.7%, sales 3.78%</p>
<p>Average		  194.10    550.50    11,754.72  12,214.60</p>
<p>High		     650.00		  13,000.00</p>
<p>Low		     -271.00		  10,603.00</p>
<p>--Bombay equities desk 91-22-265-9000</p>
